 THE MAPS</a></strong></p>\n<p>As always it’s a free texture, you can do whatever you want with it. Just don’t be a prick a tell it’s yours.</p>\n<p>If you like my work and you find it good enough to use on your work, consider giving me a small tip using the right&nbsp;menu and in return I’ll provide you a link to the folder where I have all my textures and you can download them all with a single click.</p>\n<p>Take care and be around, I’ll be posting more soon.</p>\n",
